--- Attribute Assignment Rules ---
--- Static attributes ---
PASS: public static can be set
PASS: public static supports +=
PASS: private static from outside -> Cannot access private static field 'secret'
PASS: protected static from outside -> Cannot access protected static field 'shared'
PASS: static constant reassigned -> Cannot reassign static constant 'LIMIT'
PASS: private static set from inside the class
PASS: protected static set from a subclass
PASS: parent's private static set from a subclass -> Cannot access private static field 'secret'
--- Instance attributes ---
PASS: public attribute can be set
PASS: protected attribute from outside -> Cannot access protected member 'prot'
PASS: constant attribute from outside -> Cannot reassign constant 'fixed'
PASS: constant attribute from inside -> Cannot reassign constant 'fixed'
PASS: protected attribute set from a subclass
PASS: private value is never overwritten from outside
--- Shadowing ---
PASS: instance attribute may not shadow a static constant -> Cannot shadow static constant 'LIMIT' with an instance variable
